,y)={x}_{1}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{1}-3{x}_{3}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}$ is given above. What is the value of $a+b+c?$" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366070 1113 #uuid "b10e7084-45ad-5978-87c8-4808b0be70b8" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366070 1145 "Each term ${a}_{ij}{x}_{i}{y}_{j}$ in the expression of the bilinear form corresponds to the entry ${a}_{ij}$ of the matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(x,y) & ={x}_{1}{y}_{2}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{1}-3{x}_{3}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3} \\\\  & =0{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+1{x}_{1}{y}_{2}+0{x}_{1}{y}_{3} \\\\  & +\\,3{x}_{2}{y}_{1}+0{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+0{x}_{2}{y}_{3} \\\\  & +\\,0{x}_{3}{y}_{1}+(-3){x}_{3}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, the corresponding matrix of the bilinear form is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=1,$ $b=3,$ and $c=2.$ Finally, \n\n$$\na+b+c=1+3+2=6.\n$$" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366072 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366073 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366074 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366075 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186366076 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1041 "selection" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1104 #edb/ref 17592186366074 13194139535782 true] [17592186366071 1110 #uuid "ed45c267-15d0-55f9-8584-ff5e403bcc8e" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366072 1034 "3" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535782 true] [17592186366072 1111 #uuid "8c40c08b-c93d-5def-af01-c24b25ae8939" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366073 1034 "7" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366073 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535782 true] [17592186366073 1111 #uuid "716c2ae5-3dd7-564a-9933-303c6c2e55cb" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366074 1034 "6" 13194139535782 true] [17592186366074 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1319